<title>ISRAEL: Quake shakes Israel - official.</title>
<headline>Quake shakes Israel - official.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake shook the Israeli city of Tel Aviv on Monday, residents and officials said.</p>
<p>Residents of the Mediterranean seaside city said the tremor shook buildings for about 20 seconds but there were no immediate reports of casualties or damage.</p>
<p>Israel's Seismology Institute confirmed a quake rocked Israel but had no other details.</p>
